Track the current alphabetic word so that a spelling split across tokens is
recognized too. Russian case forms have different strengths; the incomplete
stem вс also fires, even inside a longer word. French, German, Spanish and
Italian equivalents give a much smaller signal. This deliberately omits
unrelated token-specific outliers and does not infer logical quantification.
